{"3500700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mythbreak", "steam_appid": 3500700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You play the boss. You play the hero.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.poster.avif?t=1778778493\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.webm?t=1778778493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.mp4?t=1778778493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mythbreak</i> is a PvP arena brawler featuring fast-paced 3v1 asymmetrical gameplay. Dive into the action as one of three heroes working together to take down a fearsome boss or become the boss itself and unleash havoc on your friends. Whether you are coordinating strategies as a team or dominating the battlefield with sheer force, Mythbreak offers dynamic battles packed with action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/ecf245e5332c4ca7dfa298c83e6dcbce.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/ecf245e5332c4ca7dfa298c83e6dcbce.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero and boss boasts a different skill set and playstyle, opening up countless strategies and ways to play. Combining the thrill of raid battles with the competitive spirit of an arena brawler, Mythbreak delivers a fresh and engaging gameplay experience every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/36a20d94efa5fc3adb01e85445702487.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/36a20d94efa5fc3adb01e85445702487.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an online multiplayer game with a focus on teamwork, Mythbreak is designed to be a shared experience. Rally your squad, choose your roles and battle it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/d372a47426e29003e3f8ff76842443be.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/d372a47426e29003e3f8ff76842443be.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the Eddyr, a magical relic that seals ancient myths within its pages. As you face its vengeful bosses or fight human heroes, collect lore to gradually uncover their  histories and the stories behind them, get achivements and unlock skins to show off.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You play the boss. You play the hero.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.poster.avif?t=1778778493\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.webm?t=1778778493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/960465b2f50c164aedf0af31eab4dd7b.mp4?t=1778778493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mythbreak</i> is a PvP arena brawler featuring fast-paced 3v1 asymmetrical gameplay. Dive into the action as one of three heroes working together to take down a fearsome boss or become the boss itself and unleash havoc on your friends. Whether you are coordinating strategies as a team or dominating the battlefield with sheer force, Mythbreak offers dynamic battles packed with action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/ecf245e5332c4ca7dfa298c83e6dcbce.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/ecf245e5332c4ca7dfa298c83e6dcbce.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero and boss boasts a different skill set and playstyle, opening up countless strategies and ways to play. Combining the thrill of raid battles with the competitive spirit of an arena brawler, Mythbreak delivers a fresh and engaging gameplay experience every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/36a20d94efa5fc3adb01e85445702487.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/36a20d94efa5fc3adb01e85445702487.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an online multiplayer game with a focus on teamwork, Mythbreak is designed to be a shared experience. Rally your squad, choose your roles and battle it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras/d372a47426e29003e3f8ff76842443be.avif?t=1778778493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/extras_big/d372a47426e29003e3f8ff76842443be.avif?t=1778778493 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the Eddyr, a magical relic that seals ancient myths within its pages. As you face its vengeful bosses or fight human heroes, collect lore to gradually uncover their  histories and the stories behind them, get achivements and unlock skins to show off.</p>", "short_description": "Mythbreak is a fast-paced 3v1 arena brawler where one player becomes a powerful boss. Pick a side and battle your friends in mythical arenas built for skill, strategy and utter chaos. Coming soon!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/7b7cbf5edcb69d31e388edf23f52f1ab235c7470/header.jpg?t=1778778493", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/8b08c89d23c2ec2304883723e6f4c8372fdcee58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778778493", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500700/8b08c89d23c2ec2304883723e6f4c8372fdcee58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778778493", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage